     A** Claim Master Security ****************************************
     A            CXCLDL    R               REFFLD(LVL)
     A                                      COLHDG('CLM DLT' 'SEC LVL')
     A            CXCLDT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('CLM DLT' 'SEC TYP')
     A*******      Valid values: *blank (for all) or FTGTP via 'SECT'
     A            CXCLTL    R               REFFLD(LVL)
     A                                      COLHDG('CLM XFER' 'SEC LVL')
     A            CXCLTT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('CLM XFER' 'SEC TYP')
     A*******      Valid values: *blank (for all) or FTGTP via 'SECT'
     A            CXWCUP    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('ALLOW' 'UPD OF' 'WCMS CLM')
     A*******      Valid values: Y = update WCMS claim fields in WCMC
     A*******                    N = WCMS claim fields are protected in WCMC
     A*******                        and kept in sync only thru WCMS Claim Mstr
     A**
     A** EOMB/Provider Bill Security **********************************
     A            CXCKDL    R               REFFLD(LVL)
     A                                      COLHDG('EOMB W/CHK' 'DLT SEC LVL')
     A            CXCKDT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('EOMB W/CHK' 'DLT SEC TYP')
     A*******      Valid values: *blank (for all) or FTGTP via 'SECT'
     A*******      NOTE:  The security is set here, because there will
     A*******             be two different security processes in EOMB
     A*******             Delete:
     A*******                1.  User can delete an EOMB - will be
     A*******                    controlled by the Function/Option
     A*******                    special authority process off the
     A*******                    4=Delete option in "Work w/EOMBs".
     A*******                2.  User can delete an EOMB if there is
     A*******                    a WCMS Check (WDPAP) attached - will
     A*******                    be controlled by CXCKDL/CXCKDT security
     A*******                    within the deletion program itself.
     A            CXRCAL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('EOMB RECON' 'ALLOWED')
     A*******      Valid values: Y = Recon allowed
     A*******      Valid values: N = Recon NOT allowed
     A            CXRCSL    R               REFFLD(LVL)
     A                                      COLHDG('EOMB RECON' 'SEC LVL')
     A            CXRCST    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('EOMB RECON' 'SEC TYP')
     A*******      Valid values: *blank (for all) or FTGTP via 'SECT'
     A            CXRCRM    R               REFFLD(RMCD)
     A*** BEG CHG *** 03/05/99 **************************
     A******************************        COLHDG('EOMB RECON' 'DARTS RMK CD')
     A                                      COLHDG('NOT USED')
     A*** BEG CHG *** 03/05/99 **************************
     A*******      Valid values: STCTP
