     A** EOMB/Provider Bill Workflow **********************************
     A            CXAPSC    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('SHOW' 'ADJ/PEND' 'SCRN')
     A*******      Valid values: Y = show Adj/Pend screen
     A*******                    *blank = show Adj/Pend screen
     A            CXAPDF    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('ADJ/PEND' 'DEFAULT')
     A*******      Valid values: A = Adj will be marked "Y"
     A*******                    P = Pend will be marked "Y"
     A            CXAPPN    R               REFFLD(CODE3)
     A                                      COLHDG('ADJ/PEND' 'DEFAULT' 'CODE')
     A*******      Valid values: based on "P" type FTBSP/BSCODE
     A*******      NOTE:  Required if Pend chosen as default
     A            CXCPSC    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('SHOW' 'CMPLT/PEND' 'SCRN')
     A*******      Valid values: Y = show Cmplt/Pend screen
     A*******                    *blank = show Cmplt/Pend screen
     A            CXCPDF    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('CMPLT/PEND' 'DEFAULT')
     A*******      Valid values: C = Complete will be marked "Y"
     A*******                    P = Pend will be marked "Y"
     A            CXCPPN    R               REFFLD(CODE3)
     A                                      COLHDG('CMPL/PEND' 'DEFAULT' 'CODE')
     A*******      Valid values: based on "P" type FTBSP/BSCODE
     A*******      NOTE:  Required if Pend chosen as default
